  "body": "Home\nAbout us\nIndustries\nManufacturing and industrial\nArchitecture and Buildings\nServices\nScanning\nScan to BIM\nAs-Built Drafting\n3D Modeling\nBuilding analysis\nBOMA As-Built Digital Plans\nMatterport 3D Virtual Tours\nDigital Twins\nBlog\nCase studies\nContact\nGet in touch\n(514) 606-9604\nEnglish\nen\nFrançais\nfr\nINDUSTRY AND MANUFACTURING\nWe enable companies to transform and optimize their operations with versatile digital twins, making it easier to organize the space to drive growth.\nGet a quote 🡒\nContact us 🡒\nWork with us 🡒\nComprehensive 3D Solutions\nTAILORED TO YOUR NEEDS\n3D LiDAR SCANNING\nFast and precise 3D LiDAR data capture for infrastructure, facades, mechanic, ceilings and roofing.\n3D MODELING\nAccurate 3D models and plans, from scan to BIM, CAD, Revit, STEP, and SAT. Tailored to meet your project’s needs. Perfect for architecture, construction, manufacturing, industry, and more.\nBUILDING ANALYSIS\nStructural and facade analysis for deformation, flatness, verticality, and heritage preservation.\nBOMA\nAs-Built Digital Plans\nStandardized BOMA measurements for accurate area calculations. Ideal for property managers, landlords, and owners.\nPROGRESS REPORTING\nAccurate surveys and as-built 3D scans, plans, and models providing precise data for project tracking and quality assessment.\nSCAN TO BIM\nFrom 3D scan to BIM, we produce precise as-built models including architectural, structural, and MEP elements.\nAS-BUILT DRAFTING\nAccurate as-built 2D and 3D plans created from detailed 3D scans. From basic layouts to highly detailed plans of structures, facades, mechanical systems, roofing, and more.\n360° PHOTO\nPrecise, high-resolution 360° site photography that can be converted into immersive and interactive Matterport virtual tours.\nMATTERPORT VIRTUAL TOURS\nImmersive and secure 3D Matterport virtual tours. Perfect for marketing initiatives, presentations, and remote project access.\nDIGITAL TWINS\nAccurate 3D digital twins powered by Prevu3D for visualization, simulation, and facility management.\nStart your next project with\npointSpace.\nLet’s Connect\nCase studies 🡒\nWe completed over\n400 PROJECTS\nWe collaborate with clients across various industries, including construction, architecture, industrial, and manufacturing. Our goal is always to deliver practical, tailored solutions that align with your needs.\n3\nD Scan and 3D Modeling of an Industrial Facility\nVAC AERO International Inc.\nSee the case study\n3\nD Scan and 3D Modeling of a Sawmill\nCDF Group\nSee the case study\nHealth & Safety issues in an industrial site\nGroupe Renfort\nSee the case study\n\"A high-quality, fast, and efficient service.\"\n- Juliano Rodriguez-Daoust, VP Business Development and Acquisitions\nCarosielli Group\nWork with us 🡒\n\"The service was A1, we made several changes and these were always made quickly.\"\n-\nOlivier Tremblay, Process Improvement and Maintenance Manager\nNelmar\nShare by:",
